{"seq":3,"slug":"auction-liquidity-price-discovery","title":"竞价流动性与价格发现度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-fraud-ops/auction-liquidity-price-discovery","wordCount":2326,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"竞价流动性与价格发现度量\">竞价流动性与价格发现度量</h1><p>拍卖平台的健康度不能用 GMV 一个数字概括。一个 GMV 很高的平台可能靠少数几件天价标的撑着，其余标的全部流拍；也可能成交率很高但成交价长期贴着保留价，说明价格发现根本没有发生、拍卖退化成了「走过场的固定价」。本章要建立的是能够区分这些情形的度量体系——它对应一个明确的问题：<strong>这件标的的价格，究竟是被竞价过程发现的，还是被卖家单方面设定的？</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>价格发现</strong>是「通过买卖双方互动确定资产价格的过程」；它与估值不同，价格发现反映的是某一时刻、某一场所实际产生的成交价（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Price_discovery\">Wikipedia, Price discovery</a>）。拍卖是价格发现的典型机制：卖家不知道标的市场价，通过竞价让分散的信息汇聚成一个价格。</p>\n<p>流动性则是「能否快速、低成本地完成交易」。对连续市场，流动性常以买卖价差衡量；对拍卖市场，需要一套对应物。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>连续市场概念</th>\n<th>拍卖市场对应物</th>\n<th>直观含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>买卖价差</td>\n<td>保留价与成交价之差</td>\n<td>交易的摩擦成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场深度</td>\n<td>有效出价人数</td>\n<td>有多少人在争</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成交速度</td>\n<td>从开拍到首次出价的时间</td>\n<td>需求被激活的速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格连续性</td>\n<td>同类标的成交价离散度</td>\n<td>定价的可参照性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[拍卖结果事件] --&gt; B[参与度指标]&#10;  A --&gt; C[价格指标]&#10;  A --&gt; D[效率指标]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[出价密度&lt;br/&gt;出价数/标的]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[独立出价人数]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[价格实现度&lt;br/&gt;成交价/估价]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[保留价贴合度]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[成交率]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[重上架率]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[首出价时延]&#10;  B1 --&gt; E[专场健康度分]&#10;  B2 --&gt; E&#10;  C1 --&gt; E&#10;  C2 --&gt; E&#10;  D1 --&gt; E&#10;  D2 --&gt; E&#10;  D3 --&gt; E\">graph TD\n  A[拍卖结果事件] --&gt; B[参与度指标]\n  A --&gt; C[价格指标]\n  A --&gt; D[效率指标]\n  B --&gt; B1[出价密度&lt;br/&gt;出价数/标的]\n  B --&gt; B2[独立出价人数]\n  C --&gt; C1[价格实现度&lt;br/&gt;成交价/估价]\n  C --&gt; C2[保留价贴合度]\n  D --&gt; D1[成交率]\n  D --&gt; D2[重上架率]\n  D --&gt; D3[首出价时延]\n  B1 --&gt; E[专场健康度分]\n  B2 --&gt; E\n  C1 --&gt; E\n  C2 --&gt; E\n  D1 --&gt; E\n  D2 --&gt; E\n  D3 --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"参与度度量\">参与度度量</h2><h3 id=\"出价密度\">出价密度</h3><p>出价密度定义为「每场拍卖的有效出价笔数」。它是拍卖最基础的流动性代理量：出价笔数少意味着竞争不足，价格没有经过多轮信息汇聚。</p>\n<p>但出价密度必须与<strong>独立出价人数</strong>一起看。同一个账号通过代理出价连续抬价十次，与十个不同账号各出一次，在笔数上可能相同，在流动性含义上完全不同。前者是一个人的独角戏，后者才是真正的市场。</p>\n<h3 id=\"首出价时延\">首出价时延</h3><p>从开拍到第一笔有效出价的时间。它衡量需求被激活的速度：时延过长（例如一半标的在结束前六小时仍无人出价）说明蓄水不足或定价脱离市场，对应专场排期的问题，见 <a href=\"auction-session-schedule\">拍卖专场与排期运营</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"计算口径\">计算口径</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH per_auction AS (&#10;  SELECT a.auction_id,&#10;         a.start_price,&#10;         a.reserve_price,&#10;         a.final_price,&#10;         a.status,&#10;         min(b.created_at) FILTER (WHERE b.withdrawn_at IS NULL) AS first_bid_at,&#10;         count(*) FILTER (WHERE b.withdrawn_at IS NULL)         AS effective_bids,&#10;         count(DISTINCT b.bidder_id) FILTER (WHERE b.withdrawn_at IS NULL) AS distinct_bidders&#10;    FROM auction a&#10;    LEFT JOIN bid b USING (auction_id)&#10;   WHERE a.status IN (&#39;sold&#39;,&#39;reserve_not_met&#39;,&#39;no_bid&#39;)&#10;   GROUP BY 1,2,3,4,5&#10;)&#10;SELECT date_trunc(&#39;week&#39;, a.close_time) AS week,&#10;       count(*)                                                        AS auctions,&#10;       round(avg(effective_bids), 2)                                   AS bid_density,&#10;       round(avg(distinct_bidders), 2)                                 AS bidder_depth,&#10;       round(percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (&#10;               ORDER BY extract(epoch FROM (first_bid_at - a.close_time))/60&#10;             )::numeric, 1)                                            AS median_minutes_before_close&#10;  FROM per_auction p JOIN auction a USING (auction_id)&#10; GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> per_auction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auction_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">start_price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reserve_price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">final_price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withdrawn_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first_bid_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withdrawn_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> effective_bids,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bidder_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withdrawn_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distinct_bidders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (auction_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sold'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reserve_not_met'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no_bid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'week'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">close_time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> week</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auctions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(effective_bids), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid_density,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(distinct_bidders), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bidder_depth,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> extract(epoch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (first_bid_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">close_time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">             )::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> median_minutes_before_close</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> per_auction p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (auction_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>distinct_bidders</code> 与 <code>effective_bids</code> 必须用同样的过滤条件（<code>withdrawn_at IS NULL</code>），否则撤回过的出价会让两个指标口径不一致——这正是 <a href=\"../proxy-bid-anti-snipe/bid-withdraw-rule\">出价撤回与有效规则</a> 里那个部分索引要解决的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格实现度\">价格实现度</h2><h3 id=\"定义与陷阱\">定义与陷阱</h3><p>价格实现度通常定义为「成交价 / 参考估价」。分母的选取决定了这个指标的可靠性：用卖家自己的估价做分母，会得到一个持续偏低的比值（卖家系统性高估）；用同类标的的历史成交中位数做分母，才有跨标的可比性。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>achieved</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><mrow><mtext>median</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>comparables</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{achieved}} = \\frac{p_{\\text{final}}}{\\text{median}(p_{\\text{comparables}})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">achieved</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0797em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">comparables</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>比值长期显著小于 1，说明该品类的卖家预期系统性高于市场；长期显著大于 1，则可能是品类被过度追捧，或者参考集中混入了不同成色的标的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保留价贴合度\">保留价贴合度</h3><p>另一个更直接的指标是保留价与市场价的偏离。保留价是可观测的卖家底线，与同类成交中位数比较即可判断卖家的定价是否符合市场。这个指标的价值在于<strong>可操作性</strong>：偏离过大时平台可以直接给出定价建议，而不用等到流拍发生。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算</th>\n<th>偏高说明</th>\n<th>偏低说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价格实现度</td>\n<td>成交价 / 同类中位</td>\n<td>品类被追捧或样本偏差</td>\n<td>卖家预期过高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留价贴合度</td>\n<td>保留价 / 同类中位</td>\n<td>流拍风险高</td>\n<td>卖家让利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留价达成率</td>\n<td>达成保留价场次 / 有出价场次</td>\n<td>定价务实</td>\n<td>保留价虚高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上探倍数</td>\n<td>成交价 / 起拍价</td>\n<td>起拍价过低（吸引有效）</td>\n<td>起拍价虚高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>上探倍数</code> 特别有用：起拍价定得很低会带来很高的上探倍数与高成交率，这是常见的运营手法，但倍数过高也意味着起拍价失去了筛选作用、吸引了大量低意向围观者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流动性度量-价差思想的迁移\">流动性度量：价差思想的迁移</h2><h3 id=\"保留价作为-要价\">保留价作为「要价」</h3><p>连续市场里买卖价差是流动性的核心度量，它的大小「既是市场流动性的一个度量，也是交易成本的度量」（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bid%E2%80%93ask_spread\">Wikipedia, Bid–ask spread</a>）。拍卖里最接近「要价」的量就是保留价：它是卖家愿意出售的最低价格，等价于一个挂在市场上的卖出报价；而买方的出价上限则是「出价」。</p>\n<p>于是可以构造一个拍卖版的相对价差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>spread</mtext><mtext>rel</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>reserve</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>top_max</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>mid</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>mid</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>reserve</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>top_max</mtext></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{spread}_{\\text{rel}} = \\frac{p_{\\text{reserve}} - p_{\\text{top\\_max}}}{p_{\\text{mid}}},\\quad p_{\\text{mid}} = \\frac{p_{\\text{reserve}} + p_{\\text{top\\_max}}}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">spread</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2208em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3403em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.757em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reserve</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">top_max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0263em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3403em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.757em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reserve</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">top_max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个量在流拍场次上尤其有诊断力：<code>reserve_not_met</code> 的场次普遍具有正且较大的 <code>spread_rel</code>（保留价高于最高出价上限），而成交场次普遍为负。它的工程价值在于把「为什么没成交」从定性描述变成了一个可比较的数字。</p>\n<h3 id=\"有效价差与实现价差\">有效价差与实现价差</h3><p>连续市场区分报价价差、有效价差与实现价差，后者剔除报价调整、隔离出「即时性的成本」（同上）。拍卖里的对应区分是：用<strong>出价上限</strong>算的叫有效价差（反映真实意愿），用<strong>实际出价金额</strong>算的叫实现价差（反映实际支付）。两者之差就是代理出价机制为用户省下的部分——这正是代理出价的价值所在，见 <a href=\"../proxy-bid-anti-snipe/proxy-bidding-agent\">代理出价（proxy bid）机制</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>价差口径</th>\n<th>拍卖对应</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>报价价差</td>\n<td>保留价 − 出价金额</td>\n<td>表面摩擦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有效价差</td>\n<td>保留价 − 出价上限</td>\n<td>真实意愿下的摩擦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现价差</td>\n<td>成交价 − 次高上限</td>\n<td>代理机制省下的金额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"指标口径纪律与看板\">指标口径纪律与看板</h2><h3 id=\"三条必须遵守的口径纪律\">三条必须遵守的口径纪律</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>分母要写明</strong>。成交率的分母是「结束的场次」还是「上架的场次」，会给出相差很大的数字；后者把未开拍的也算进失败。</li>\n<li><strong>分子要过滤无效</strong>。所有参与度与价格指标都必须排除已撤回、已作废的出价，否则会被操纵行为直接污染，见 <a href=\"shill-bid-rig-detect\">托儿、围标与操纵识别</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>同口径可比</strong>。跨周、跨品类比较时必须固定口径与窗口，否则曲线上的「变化」可能只是口径漂移。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"看板结构\">看板结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;dashboard&quot;: &quot;auction_health&quot;,&#10;  &quot;panels&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;成交率&quot;, &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;sold / closed&quot;, &quot;slice&quot;: [&quot;category&quot;, &quot;session&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;出价密度&quot;, &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;avg_effective_bids&quot;, &quot;slice&quot;: [&quot;category&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;参与深度&quot;, &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;avg_distinct_bidders&quot;, &quot;slice&quot;: [&quot;category&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;价格实现度&quot;, &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;final / comparable_median&quot;, &quot;slice&quot;: [&quot;category&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;流拍归因&quot;, &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;share_by_outcome&quot;, &quot;slice&quot;: [&quot;outcome&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;首出价时延&quot;, &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;median_minutes_to_first&quot;, &quot;slice&quot;: [&quot;session&quot;] }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;guards&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;exclude_withdrawn_bids&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;denominator&quot;: &quot;closed_auctions_only&quot;,&#10;    &quot;window&quot;: &quot;iso_week&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dashboard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auction_health\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"panels\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"成交率\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sold / closed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"slice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"session\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"出价密度\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"avg_effective_bids\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"slice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"参与深度\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"avg_distinct_bidders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"slice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"价格实现度\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"final / comparable_median\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"slice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"流拍归因\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"share_by_outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"slice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"首出价时延\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"median_minutes_to_first\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"slice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"session\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"guards\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"exclude_withdrawn_bids\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"denominator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"closed_auctions_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"iso_week\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>流拍归因</code> 这一格是整块看板的诊断入口：它直接展示 <code>no_bid</code> 与 <code>reserve_not_met</code> 的占比，两者对应完全不同的处置方向，见 <a href=\"../auction-close-settle/unsold-relist-flow\">流拍处理与重新上拍</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"专场粒度的下钻\">专场粒度的下钻</h3><p>看板必须能从「整体」下钻到「专场」，否则运营看到的是无法行动的数字。专场维度的关键比较是「同主题专场之间的成交率与出价密度差异」：如果同主题的若干专场表现分化明显，问题可能在选品或结束时间；如果全都偏低，问题更可能在品类本身或定价共识。这个下钻直接对接排期决策，见 <a href=\"auction-session-schedule\">拍卖专场与排期运营</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>下钻层级</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>典型动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全平台</td>\n<td>整体是否健康</td>\n<td>无（仅监控）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类</td>\n<td>哪个品类的价格发现失效</td>\n<td>定价指引、品类运营</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专场</td>\n<td>哪一场的排期或选品有问题</td>\n<td>调整排期、重选品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单标的</td>\n<td>为什么这一件流拍</td>\n<td>查看出价轨迹与保留价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"指标的操纵风险\">指标的操纵风险</h3><p>任何被用于考核的指标都会被优化，这是必须提前防守的一点。如果运营按「成交率」考核，最省事的做法是鼓励卖家定零保留价；如果按「出价密度」考核，最省事的做法是放宽出价门槛。因此看板必须<strong>成组观察</strong>：成交率上升但价格实现度下降，说明是在用降价换成交；出价密度上升但独立出价人数不变，说明是单人多轮抬价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>价格发现衡量的是「价格是否由竞价过程产生」，与 GMV、成交率是不同维度，需要独立度量。</li>\n<li>出价密度必须与独立出价人数同看，笔数相同而人数不同的含义完全不同。</li>\n<li>价格实现度的分母必须用同类标的历史成交中位数，不能使用卖家估价。</li>\n<li>上探倍数高说明起拍价低、筛选作用弱；保留价贴合度是可提前干预的定价信号。</li>\n<li>保留价可视为「要价」，由此构造的出价上限—保留价相对价差，能把流拍原因从定性变成可比较数字。</li>\n<li>指标口径三条纪律：写明分母、过滤无效出价、同口径可比。</li>\n<li>被考核的指标必被优化，因此看板必须成组观察，防止用降价换成交率之类的伪改善。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"竞价流动性与价格发现度量","id":"竞价流动性与价格发现度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"参与度度量","id":"参与度度量"},{"level":3,"text":"出价密度","id":"出价密度"},{"level":3,"text":"首出价时延","id":"首出价时延"},{"level":3,"text":"计算口径","id":"计算口径"},{"level":2,"text":"价格实现度","id":"价格实现度"},{"level":3,"text":"定义与陷阱","id":"定义与陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"保留价贴合度","id":"保留价贴合度"},{"level":2,"text":"流动性度量：价差思想的迁移","id":"流动性度量-价差思想的迁移"},{"level":3,"text":"保留价作为「要价」","id":"保留价作为-要价"},{"level":3,"text":"有效价差与实现价差","id":"有效价差与实现价差"},{"level":2,"text":"指标口径纪律与看板","id":"指标口径纪律与看板"},{"level":3,"text":"三条必须遵守的口径纪律","id":"三条必须遵守的口径纪律"},{"level":3,"text":"看板结构","id":"看板结构"},{"level":3,"text":"专场粒度的下钻","id":"专场粒度的下钻"},{"level":3,"text":"指标的操纵风险","id":"指标的操纵风险"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"拍卖专场与排期运营","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-fraud-ops/auction-session-schedule"},"next":null}